<title>USA: DecisionOne sees Q1 EPS $0.17-$0.20.</title>
<headline>DecisionOne sees Q1 EPS $0.17-$0.20.</headline>
<dateline>FRAZER, Pa. 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>DecisionOne Holdings Corp said on Tuesday it expects net income for the first quarter to be in the range of $5.1 million, or $0.17 per share, to $6.0 million, or $0.20 per share.</p>
<p>The company said it sees its first quarter revenues at about $175 million.</p>
<p>For the fiscal year 1997, the company said its objective is to achieve earnings in the range of $1.10 per share to $1.30 per share.</p>
</text>
